{"id":"n65675-1-7","stage":5,"title":"신속 · 迅速","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65675-1-7-1","ko":"이 음식점에서 음식을 자주 시켜 먹는 이유가 뭐야?","zh":"你经常在这家餐厅点餐的原因是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"음식점에서","meaning":"餐厅，饭店","explanation":"음식점：餐厅，饭店；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"음식점","audio":"/audio/8d923a58de0234811588.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24055","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식점에서","audio":"/audio/c1923da1e1ea87bd2bb4.mp3"}},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常。","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"시켜","meaning":"点，叫","explanation":"시키다：点，叫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"2","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시켜","audio":"/audio/e07de763467027c6d0f5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹는","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹는","audio":"/audio/8eed52fccdd9cbc6591a.mp3"}},{"text":"이유가","meaning":"理由","explanation":"이유：理由；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62386","senseId":"1","lemma":"이유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이유가","audio":"/audio/31a72eab8830677dbc1a.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐야?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"8d923a58de023481","term":"음식점","zh":"餐厅，饭店","audio":"/audio/8d923a58de0234811588.mp3","entryId":"24055","definition":"制作出售食物的店铺。","pronunciation":["음ː식쩜"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"0258d8fe6108bb9c","term":"시키다","zh":"点，叫","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3","entryId":"29769","definition":"下单购买食物、酒、饮料等。","pronunciation":["시키다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"6445cb23ec9811b5","term":"이유","zh":"理由","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"使某个结果发生的原因或根据。","pronunciation":["이ː유"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/bfb5e90755409826dfb7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65675-1-7-2","ko":"어떤 메뉴든지 신속 배달해 주거든.","zh":"因为不管点什么菜，都能很快送到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"无论哪个，无论什么","explanation":"어떤：无论哪个，无论什么。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"4","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"메뉴든지","meaning":"菜品","explanation":"메뉴：菜品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；든지：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57299","senseId":"2","lemma":"메뉴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메뉴든지","audio":"/audio/08f82ac7f57a3bf48ec2.mp3"}},{"text":"신속","meaning":"迅速","explanation":"신속：迅速。","readings":[{"term":"신속","audio":"/audio/31f02f124ad510e23c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65675","senseId":"1","lemma":"신속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신속","audio":"/audio/31f02f124ad510e23c82.mp3"}},{"text":"배달해","meaning":"配送，投递，送货","explanation":"배달하다：配送，投递，送货；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"배달하다","audio":"/audio/c78110d1720c09d02134.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58801","senseId":"1","lemma":"배달하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배달해","audio":"/audio/0b265f3b39e68d890036.mp3"}},{"text":"주거든.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주거든","audio":"/audio/d68bb6ef11863efb4843.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"无论哪个，无论什么","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于不特指某个相关对象。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"13b36d6d0ccc7f49","term":"메뉴","zh":"菜品","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3","entryId":"57299","definition":"料理的种类。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"31f02f124ad510e2","term":"신속","zh":"迅速","audio":"/audio/31f02f124ad510e23c82.mp3","entryId":"65675","definition":"处理事情或行动等非常快速。","pronunciation":["신ː속"]},{"id":"c78110d1720c09d0","term":"배달하다","zh":"配送，投递，送货","audio":"/audio/c78110d1720c09d02134.mp3","entryId":"58801","definition":"把邮件、东西或食物等送到别人手中。","pronunciation":["배ː달하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ea5c7bbf6f483313b88.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.502,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65675","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":169,"sequenceScore":3.3287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你经常在这家餐厅点餐的原因是什么？","因为不管点什么菜，都能很快送到。","从历史记载来看，一千年前就已经有与外国的贸易记录了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你经常在这家餐厅点餐的原因是什么？","因为不管点什么菜，都能很快送到。","从历史记载来看，一千年前就已经有与外国的贸易记录了。"],"answer":1}]}
